WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:11.644
- [groans]
- ALL RIGHT, PARTNER.

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:13.780
TAKE THIS SCUMBAG DOWNTOWN

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.682
BEFORE THE MEXICANS FIND HIM
AND BLOW HIS ASS AWAY.

00:00:16.715 --> 00:00:19.685
- WE'RE GONNA
KEEP YOU ALIVE, CHICO.

00:00:19.718 --> 00:00:20.686
<i> COMPRENDE?</i>

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:23.656
- [laughs]

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:30.363
[dramatic music]

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:38.371
♪ ♪

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:22.148
[sustained]
NO!

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:30.156
♪ ♪

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:21.607
[crying]

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:26.546
NO!

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.514
[bird squawks]

00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:31.518
[explosion, bird crows]

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:34.887
WHAT?
IS THAT A BIRD?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.689
- HEY! HEY.

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:38.391
DO YOU KNOW WHAT HAPPENED?

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.626
- NO.

00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:43.630
OH!

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.501
OH, I GET IT.

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:50.903
WHEN I SAY "NO,"
STUFF BLOWS UP.

00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:55.775
[explosion,
glass shatters]

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.777
COOL.

